## ✅ Prerequisites

You will need:

| Server | Role | Required |
|--------|------|----------|
| `Principal Server` | Primary active database | ✅ Required |
| `Mirror Server` | Standby replica | ✅ Required |
| `Witness Server` | Arbitrator for automatic failover | ⚡ Optional |

> 💡 **Tip:** Configuration is easiest when all servers are in the **same domain**.

### Service Account
Create a service account on both servers:
```
svc_mirror_account
```
> This can be a **single domain account** shared across both servers, or two separate accounts.

