## 📌 Useful Commands

### Read Error Logs
```sql
-- Check mirroring errors
EXEC xp_readerrorlog 0, 1, N'Mirroring';

-- Check login errors
EXEC xp_readerrorlog 0, 1, N'login';
```

### Reset / Clear Mirroring
```sql
-- Run on BOTH servers to remove mirroring:
ALTER DATABASE [YourDatabaseName] SET PARTNER OFF;
```

### Manual Failover
```sql
-- Run on PRINCIPAL only:
ALTER DATABASE [YourDatabaseName] SET PARTNER FAILOVER;
```

### Common Error to Watch For
```
Connection handshake failed. There is no compatible encryption algorithm. State 22.
```
> → Endpoints have mismatched encryption. One is `REQUIRED`, the other is `DISABLED` or uses a different algorithm. See [Fix 6](#fix-6--verify--fix-encryption-mismatch).

