## 🔄 Full Setup Quick Reference

```
1. Prepare servers (Principal + Mirror + optional Witness)
       │
2. Enable TCP/IP on ALL servers
       │
3. Create service account (svc_mirror_account)
       │
4. Take FULL + LOG backup on Principal
       │
5. Restore with NORECOVERY on Mirror
       │
6. Configure Security Wizard on Principal (SSMS)
       │
7. Verify: Principal, Synchronized ✅
```

